  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a9c7a12d-5587-423b-a1fb-c28261771cdf",
      "name": "Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Error handler\n\nRuns when the Main workflow dies somewhere its own `Failure` branch cannot catch — a\nCode node throwing, or the instance killing a run. It reads the failed execution back\nthrough the n8n API, digs the `jobId` out of it and marks that job `failed` in the app,\nso the page stops waiting and shows a reason instead of spinning.\n\n**Config**: `TOOLS_APP_URL` (the app) and `N8N_BASE_URL` (this instance).\n**Credentials**: *n8n API* and the *bearer*.\n\nSet it on the Main workflow under Settings → Error Workflow. Generated by\n`npm run n8n:build`; do not edit here."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "770d42ff-7b6e-4afd-a3c1-a0be47751839",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "6164a04b-0b5b-449b-a17c-2380148dbd0b",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
